{"unit_id":"aitcmhk-web__DSH-bot#card-zh","repo":"aitcmhk-web/DSH-bot","commit":"d3f53c8e34192afeb90a10c389ea30f344231c9c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-botplugin 是把 Telegram 和微信接入 DeepSeek Harness 的聊天插件，提供远程消息入口并将消息交给 DSH 会话处理。它通过 Telegram Bot API 与微信 iLink 收发消息，以统一 hub 在各端点间转发，并用运行时管理会话和模型路由。主要功能包括远程对话、跨端消息同步、命令式新会话与模型切换、语音转文字，以及会话 handoff 和对话流水账。适合希望离开电脑后继续使用工作区、或从手机聊天端控制 DSH 的用户。可按需配置 Telegram bot token 或微信凭据；记忆默认写入工作目录，也可关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:463","src/hub.js:1","src/memory.js:59"]}
{"unit_id":"aitcmhk-web__DSH-bot#card-en","repo":"aitcmhk-web/DSH-bot","commit":"d3f53c8e34192afeb90a10c389ea30f344231c9c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-botplugin connects Telegram and WeChat to DSH through a shared hub. It supports remote chat, model switching, speech transcription, and handoff memory. Continue a DSH workspace from a phone. Configure endpoint credentials; memory defaults to the workspace directory.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:463","src/hub.js:1","src/memory.js:59"]}
